{"id":"n28105-2-7","stage":4,"title":"가늠 · 估计","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28105-2-7-1","ko":"저분이 나보다 나이가 많겠지?","zh":"那位应该比我年纪大吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저분이","meaning":"那；位","explanation":"저：那；분：位；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"},{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"27780","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나보다","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나이가","meaning":"年龄，年纪，岁数","explanation":"나이：年龄，年纪，岁数；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나이","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60486","senseId":"1","lemma":"나이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많겠지?","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"ca4a187881dbf529","term":"분","zh":"位","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3","entryId":"27780","definition":"对人的尊称。","pronunciation":["분"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"9584bdb8265fdb6c","term":"나이","zh":"年龄，年纪，岁数","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3","entryId":"60486","definition":"人或动植物等来到世上生存至今的年数。","pronunciation":["나이"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/1f8f67c2ae55834d95bb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28105-2-7-2","ko":"글쎄, 외모만으로는 나이를 가늠을 못하겠어.","zh":"不好说，光看外表可判断不出年龄呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"글쎄,","meaning":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","explanation":"글쎄：也许吧，或许吧，难说","readings":[{"term":"글쎄","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29723","senseId":"1","lemma":"글쎄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"외모만으로는","meaning":"外貌，外表","explanation":"외모：外貌，外表；만：表示“只、仅”。；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"외모","audio":"/audio/2b872bd16206aa00739f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22154","senseId":"1","lemma":"외모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나이를","meaning":"年龄，年纪，岁数","explanation":"나이：年龄，年纪，岁数；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"나이","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60486","senseId":"1","lemma":"나이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가늠을","meaning":"估计，估摸，掂量，估量","explanation":"가늠：估计，估摸，掂量，估量；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"가늠","audio":"/audio/f28deaed71fff57a0ecd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28105","senseId":"2","lemma":"가늠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못하겠어.","meaning":"不，未能","explanation":"못하다：不，未能；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26841","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7ca52d3e5ceed208","term":"글쎄","zh":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3","entryId":"29723","definition":"对于对方所提出的问题或要求，表现出不确定的态度。","pronunciation":["글쎄"]},{"id":"2b872bd16206aa00","term":"외모","zh":"外貌，外表","audio":"/audio/2b872bd16206aa00739f.mp3","entryId":"22154","definition":"人表面看到的模样。","pronunciation":["외ː모","웨ː모"]},{"id":"9584bdb8265fdb6c","term":"나이","zh":"年龄，年纪，岁数","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3","entryId":"60486","definition":"人或动植物等来到世上生存至今的年数。","pronunciation":["나이"]},{"id":"f28deaed71fff57a","term":"가늠","zh":"估计，估摸，掂量，估量","audio":"/audio/f28deaed71fff57a0ecd.mp3","entryId":"28105","definition":"大概猜想事物或状况的状态。","pronunciation":["가늠"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"不，未能","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"26841","definition":"表示无法到达之前的话所指的状态。","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/264d7f8c602530a55cf5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28105","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":121,"sequenceScore":1.8367,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那位应该比我年纪大吧？","不好说，光看外表可判断不出年龄呢。","你怎么只吃那么一点饭？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那位应该比我年纪大吧？","不好说，光看外表可判断不出年龄呢。","你怎么只吃那么一点饭？"],"answer":1}]}
